{% set notes = rag_notes(ref('question'), k=3) %}
Answer the question using only the team notes below. Cite the note file for each fact.
If the notes do not cover it, say so.

Question: {{ ref('question') }}

{% for hit in notes if hit %}
{{ hit }}

{% else %}
(No matching notes.)
{% endfor %}
{% if promptdata('web') %}
Web results, for anything the notes miss:
{{ rag_brave_search(ref('question'), count=3) | join("\n\n") }}
{% endif %}
